{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36179","headline":"和于中丞登扶风亭 · 方干","name":"和于中丞登扶风亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"避石攀萝去不迷，行时举步似丹梯。\n东轩海日已先照，下界晨鸡犹未啼。\n郭里云山全占寺，村前竹树半藏溪。\n谢公吟望多来此，此地应将岘首齐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36179.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36179","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}